{{/* Home page. Three jobs in this fixture:
     1. It renders the projects home carousel from siteData["projects"], which
        injectProjectsHomeCarousel fills with the FIRST -items-per-page records.
     2. It renders the courses home carousel from
        pages.index.courses_carousel_items, which injectCoursesHomeCarousel
        fills the same way. Both are the `publish:` half of their collection, so
        without them the golden files would only pin the page writers.
        The {{if $coursesSection}} gate mirrors the real template and is what
        sectionTable's courses prune hook removes when the section is off.
     3. It is the hreflang CONTROL: this page goes through writePages, so it DOES
        receive <link rel="alternate" hreflang=...>. /projects/ and /courses/ do
        not (Q2). Without a control the "no hreflang on /projects/" assertion
        would pass vacuously on a site where hreflang never runs at all.
     4. It carries the window.CASABOA_LISTINGS line VERBATIM from
        casaboa-website/src/templates/layout/base.gohtml. That line is the
        `listings` byte contract (decision record §1.3), and it is the only
        thing in this whole refactor that can ship a defect silently: a wrong
        key order, a lost `href`, a `sponsored` that vanished instead of being
        false, or a re-sorted record array all still render a valid page, still
        pass linkcheck, and still pass the sitemap check. Pinning the rendered
        line here makes it a permanent CI gate instead of a one-time manual
        diff. It is also what pins record ORDER: the detail pages are keyed by
        id on disk, so the golden file set alone is order-insensitive — the JSON
        array here and sitemap.xml are the two artefacts that are not (Q7). */}}
{{define "page_title"}}{{$p := dig .SiteData "pages" "index"}}{{if $p}}{{dig $p "title"}}{{else}}Home{{end}}{{end}}

{{define "page"}}
{{$pageData := required (dig .SiteData "pages" "index") "missing pages.index"}}
{{$carousel := dig .SiteData "projects"}}
{{$coursesSection  := dig $pageData "courses_section"}}
{{$coursesCarousel := dig $pageData "courses_carousel_items"}}
<main class="home-main" id="main-content">
  <h1 class="site-heading">{{required (dig $pageData "heading") "missing index heading"}}</h1>
  {{if $carousel}}
  <section class="projects-carousel">
    <h2>{{required (dig $pageData "projects_heading") "missing index projects_heading"}}</h2>
    <div class="carousel-track" data-carousel>
      {{range $carousel}}
      {{template "project-card-preview" (dict "Project" .)}}
      {{end}}
    </div>
    <a href="/projects/" class="carousel-more">{{required (dig $pageData "projects_more") "missing index projects_more"}}</a>
  </section>
  {{end}}
  {{if $coursesSection}}
  <section class="courses-carousel">
    <h2>{{required (dig $coursesSection "heading") "missing index courses_section.heading"}}</h2>
    <div class="carousel-track" data-carousel>
      {{range $coursesCarousel}}
      {{template "course-card-preview" (dict "Course" .)}}
      {{end}}
    </div>
    <a href="/courses/" class="carousel-more">{{required (dig $coursesSection "view_all") "missing index courses_section.view_all"}}</a>
  </section>
  {{end}}
</main>
<script>
  window.CASABOA_LISTINGS = {{with dig .SiteData "listings"}}{{toJSON .}}{{else}}[]{{end}};
</script>
{{end}}
